    <h2>Control Panel Options</h2>
    <p>
      One thing that trips people up: unmanaged VPS comes blank. Just a command line staring at you. If that sounds
      terrifying, you will want a control panel. Here are your realistic options:
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-4 my-6">
